        <p>The hardest part of user research is synthesizing 8-15 transcripts into themes without flattening the signal. Pace runs one sub-agent per transcript in parallel, then a coordinator rolls them up into a synthesis doc with quote evidence and frequency counts. A day's work becomes a 10-minute review.</p>

        <div class="usecase-setup">
