              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="usecase-step">
              <span class="usecase-step-num">3</span>
              <div class="usecase-step-body">
                <h5>Open a Claude session with your interview list</h5>
                <p>No routine needed : this one is interactive (you only run it at the end of each sprint). In Claude Code or Cowork, start a new chat.</p>
