      <article class="usecase-card usecase-card-marquee">
        <span class="usecase-card-badge">Marquee recipe</span>
        <h3>NDA triage queue</h3>
        <dl class="usecase-meta">
          <div><dt>Trigger</dt><dd>Routine, API trigger fired by your email tool's inbound webhook</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Skills</dt><dd><code>triage-nda</code>, <code>review-contract</code></dd></div>
